# Frontend environment variables. Copy to .env.local; never commit .env.local.
#
# Committed defaults live in .env.development (local dev, points at the local worker)
# and .env.production (the deployed API hostname). Only add a key here to override
# those on your own machine.
#
# Beware: Next resolves .env.local ahead of .env.production, so anything uncommented
# here also overrides a production build and is inlined into the static export.

# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:8787
